"it","s":213.48,"e":213.77,"line":40},{"w":"on","s":213.77,"e":214.07,"line":40},{"w":"and","s":214.07,"e":214.51,"line":40},{"w":"let","s":214.51,"e":214.96,"line":40},{"w":"it","s":214.96,"e":215.25,"line":40},{"w":"shine.","s":215.25,"e":216.14,"line":40}],"lines":[{"s":1.2,"e":6.43,"text":"A tired girl drops her groceries in the rain,"},{"s":6.43,"e":11.31,"text":"A stranger stops and stacks them up again."},{"s":11.31,"e":17.35,"text":"She sees his soaked sleeves, shares her little coat,"},{"s":17.35,"e":23.97,"text":"He laughs, “You saved my day,” and writes a hopeful note."},{"s":23.97,"e":29.55,"text":"She leaves that note where a lonely boy can see:"},{"s":29.55,"e":35.47,"text":"“Somebody’s glad you’re here. That somebody is me.”"},{"s":35.47,"e":40.59,"text":"He buys a bus ride for a woman short a dime;"},{"s":40.59,"e":47.44,"text":"She calls her distant sister for the first time in a while."},{"s":47.44,"e":52.55,"text":"Let love light up like stars across the sky,"},{"s":52.55,"e":57.55,"text":"One little spark can set the street alight."},{"s":57.55,"e":61.27,"text":"Hand to hand and heart to heart,"},{"s":61.27,"e":65.22,"text":"A tiny bit of good can travel far."},{"s":65.22,"e":71.49,"text":"I caught a little kindness, now I’m passing it around;"},{"s":71.49,"e":76.02,"text":"Watch the stars come out all over town."},{"s":76.02,"e":82.18,"text":"A baker packs a pastry for the kid who missed a meal,"},{"s":82.18,"e":89.15,"text":"The kid picks up a fallen sign and helps the shop next door."},{"s":89.15,"e":95.66,"text":"The shopkeeper brings flowers to a neighbor feeling low;"},{"s":95.66,"e":103.33,"text":"She puts one on a stranger’s porch with a note that says, “Hello.”"},{"s":103.33,"e":109.6,"text":"No grand parade, no glitter, no one knows their names,"},{"s":109.6,"e":115.64,"text":"Just people paying forward what another person gave."},{"s":115.64,"e":121.8,"text":"The smallest seed of sweetness finds a place to grow;"},{"s":121.8,"e":127.38,"text":"By sunset every sidewalk has a story of its own."},{"s":127.38,"e":132.49,"text":"Let love light up like stars across the sky,"},{"s":132.49,"e":137.48,"text":"One little spark can set the street alight."},{"s":137.48,"e":141.2,"text":"Hand to hand and heart to heart,"},{"s":141.2,"e":145.15,"text":"A tiny bit of good can travel far."},{"s":145.15,"e":151.43,"text":"I caught a little kindness, now I’m passing it around;"},{"s":151.43,"e":155.96,"text":"Watch the stars come out all over town."},{"s":155.96,"e":161.42,"text":"- If your world feels cold, I’ll hold the door."},{"s":161.42,"e":166.41,"text":"- If your hands are full, I can carry more."},{"s":166.41,"e":171.18,"text":"- We don’t have to solve the sky tonight."},{"s":171.18,"e":176.06,"text":"- We can give one person back their light."},{"s":176.06,"e":180.82,"text":"- Then they can give it to somebody else."},{"s":180.82,"e":185.93,"text":"Let love light up like stars across the sky,"},{"s":185.93,"e":190.93,"text":"One little spark can set the street alight."},{"s":190.93,"e":194.65,"text":"Hand to hand and heart to heart,"},{"s":194.65,"e":198.6,"text":"A tiny bit of good can travel far."},{"s":198.6,"e":204.87,"text":"I caught a little kindness, now I’m passing it around;"},{"s":204.87,"e":209.4,"text":"Watch the stars come out all over town."},{"s":209.4,"e":212.89,"text":"A little love, a little light—"},{"s":212.89,"e":216.14,"text":"Pass it on and let it shine."}],"duration":216.64,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}